IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-OPENCLAW-INIT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SESSION-ID          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOKEN-BUDGET        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 UNPINNED-TOKENS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 PINNED-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-OPENCLAW-INIT.
    IF TOKEN-BUDGET > 300
        MOVE 180 TO PINNED-TOKENS.
    ELSE
        MOVE TOKEN-BUDGET TO PINNED-TOKENS.
        DIVIDE 2 INTO PINNED-TOKENS.
    END-IF.

    MOVE TOKEN-BUDGET TO UNPINNED-TOKENS.
    SUBTRACT PINNED-TOKENS FROM UNPINNED-TOKENS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SESSION-ID.
    WEIGHT 30 PINNED-TOKENS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
